Subject: libtaskmanager: add the SandboxEngine and SandboxName roles

A task whose desktop entry carries X-Flatpak or X-KDOS-Box runs its
application in a sandbox, and the task manager can say which: SandboxEngine
is org.flatpak or io.kdos.appbox, SandboxName the Flatpak application id or
the KDOS box. Both are read with the rest of AppData from the task's
service, for window and launcher tasks alike, and refreshed when a window's
app id changes. They name where the entry launches, which is what a tooltip
line needs; the compositor's security context stays the authority on what a
running window is.

